@Demo.DistributedLock.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5121

### 健康检查
GET {{Demo.DistributedLock.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 加锁（模拟 SET NX EX；ttl 默认 10 秒，1-300；重复加锁返回 409，复制返回的 token）
POST {{Demo.DistributedLock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locks/order-1/acquire
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "ttlSeconds": 10
}

### 查看锁状态（仅回 token 前 8 位）
GET {{Demo.DistributedLock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locks/order-1
Accept: application/json

### 解锁（把 <token> 替换为加锁返回值；错误 token 返回 409，锁不存在返回 404）
POST {{Demo.DistributedLock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locks/order-1/release
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "token": "<token>"
}

### 持锁执行临界区（抢不到锁返回 409；workMs 10-5000，ttlSeconds 1-60，执行完自动释放）
POST {{Demo.DistributedLock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/critical/order-1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "workMs": 1000,
  "ttlSeconds": 5
}
